  "description": "Born into a famous shamanic family, Nam-Ju reunites with Seong-Hwa, Seung-Hyeon’s younger cousin, at Seung-Hyeon’s weddingm eight years after their first love. Seong-Hwa, who has long harbored a secret crush on Nam-Ju, realizes he still has lingering feelings for Seung-Hyeon and uses his striking resemblance to seduce him. The two gradually begin to feel drawn to each other. However, Nam-Ju is hiding a fatal reason why Seong-Hwa must never love him…\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
